+/* Continuum: an iPhone build with the recompilers on. Code memory comes from the host app as two
+   addresses for the same pages, one to run from and one to write through, because that is the only
+   shape an iPhone 13 or newer on iOS 26 allows: its one blessed code region stays read-and-execute
